ent dispatch status didn't come back, so I can't confirm right now whether it's actually sending in real time, and no send activity was recorded for the period checked either.\n\nGiven the setup looks correct on our side, it would help to pin down the exact \"no email accounts connected\" message you're seeing, since it doesn't match any recorded error. Could you reopen the campaign, check the inbox assignment screen again, and if the message still appears, send the exact wording or a screenshot of where it shows up?\n\nAlso, you mentioned two new campaigns with 12 inboxes each, but only one matching campaign was found in the records. Could you let me know the name of the second one so it can be checked too?",
